
>> shop := (Ordbog ny
	sæt: ['magazine'] ved: ['books'],
	sæt: ['computer'] ved: ['electronics'],
	sæt: ['lipstick'] ved: ['cosmetics']
).
Uddata skriv: (shop har: ['computer']), stop. 
Uddata skriv: (shop har: ['sausage']), stop. 
Uddata skriv: (shop har: ['computers']), stop. 
Uddata skriv: (shop har: ['compute']), stop. 
Uddata skriv: (shop har: ['2computer']), stop. 
